 "remarks": "Delightful cape style home offering effortless and modern upgrades on a private, fully fenced lot in prime Darien. Highlights include classic hardwood floors, a bright living room, a main-level bedroom, a den/office and two completely renovated full baths-one on each floor. The window lined dining room features a skylight and direct access to the deck which is perfect for entertaining. The second level boasts two flexible bedrooms with built-in storage and the second, completely renovated, full bath. The partially finished lower level offers a finished room which is currently used as a TV room, new washer and dryer, updated mechanicals, tankless hot water system and plenty of room for storage. This home is conveniently located minutes from downtown Darien, schools, restaurants and train stations.",
